So I think it holds up and I feel, I feel much, we've, we're becoming future Ted and I have
所以我觉得它经得起推敲，而且我觉得，我们现在越来越像年老泰德了，我对

1017
00:46:09.880 --> 00:46:10.920
a great empathy for it.
他充满了同理心。

1018
00:46:11.000 --> 00:46:15.700
Do you know what I realized would be the most insane fan edit you could ever do of How I
你们知道我意识到《老爸老妈浪漫史》最疯狂的粉丝剪辑会是什么样吗？

1019
00:46:15.700 --> 00:46:16.080
Met Your Mother?
就是，这就像是，我可不是在挑战任何人去剪这个，因为我觉得真这么做的话

1020
00:46:16.640 --> 00:46:19.760
Like, this is like, I'm not challenging anyone to do this because I actually think this would
绝对会把人逼疯。

1021
00:46:19.760 --> 00:46:22.140
be like, it would drive you mad.
那简直是一种精神折磨，那就是把《老爸老妈浪漫史》按时间顺序重新编排。

1022
00:46:22.700 --> 00:46:27.780
It would be a form of madness, which is to arrange How I Met Your Mother chronologically.
对吧。

1023
00:46:28.340 --> 00:46:28.540
Right.
把所有东西都理清楚，还有那些幽灵情节。

1024
00:46:28.740 --> 00:46:30.660
Sort it all out and take the ghost stuff.
幽灵情节才不是呢，老兄。

1025
00:46:30.780 --> 00:46:31.620
The ghost stuff's not, man.
最早的回忆杀，总之就是把一切按顺序列出来。

1026
00:46:32.300 --> 00:46:35.520
The earliest flashbacks, like just put it all in order.
哦天哪。

1027
00:46:35.660 --> 00:46:35.940
Oh my God.
那肯定绝了。

1028
00:46:35.940 --> 00:46:37.120
Like that'd be wild.
也许可以搞个文字版的。

1029
00:46:37.420 --> 00:46:38.900
Maybe a written version of it.
我们可以向大家发起挑战，写个文字版的出来。

1030
00:46:39.000 --> 00:46:40.720
We could challenge someone to do a written version of it.
真要把那东西做出来的人。

1031
00:46:40.720 --> 00:46:41.640
Whoever did that would be.
我打赌我很快就能搞定。

1032
00:46:41.660 --> 00:46:42.780
I bet I could do it pretty quick.
那种人肯定会被列入某种政府监控名单。

1033
00:46:42.820 --> 00:46:45.440
That person would be put on some kind of government watch liSt.
为了保护我们。

1034
00:46:46.720 --> 00:46:47.900
To protect us.
是啊。

1035
00:46:50.300 --> 00:46:50.700
Yeah.
我好喜欢兰吉特的出场。

1036
00:46:51.460 --> 00:46:52.880
I love Ranjit's appearance.
我觉得你们真的很。

1037
00:46:53.020 --> 00:46:54.320
I felt like you guys really.
兰吉特冲着巴尼大吼大叫，训斥他违反了兄弟法典。

1038
00:46:54.600 --> 00:46:56.860
Ranjit yelling at Barney and scolding him for breaking the bro code.
兰吉特也懂兄弟法典。

1039
00:46:56.860 --> 00:46:58.680
Ranjit knows the bro code, too.
当然了。

1040
00:46:58.940 --> 00:46:59.100
Of course.
太棒了。

1041
00:46:59.140 --> 00:47:00.140
It's fantastic.
对。

1042
00:47:00.400 --> 00:47:00.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1043
00:47:00.680 --> 00:47:00.840
Yeah.
还有马歇尔。

1044
00:47:01.440 --> 00:47:01.980
And Marshall.
巴尼的末日快要到了。

1045
00:47:02.140 --> 00:47:03.680
The walls are closing in on Barney.
你知道我的意思吧？

1046
00:47:03.900 --> 00:47:04.200
You know what I mean?
就连坐在加长轿车里的兰吉特都在说，老弟，你这次真的搞砸了。

1047
00:47:04.260 --> 00:47:08.240
Even Ranjit in that limo is like, you really fucked up, dude.
你会有一种感觉，在这一集里，我甚至觉得在《备胎兄弟》里，他完全可以打电话

1048
00:47:08.480 --> 00:47:15.080
You get the feeling that in episode, I almost feel like in Rebound Bro, he could have called
把兰吉特当成他的备用兄弟之一。

1049
00:47:15.080 --> 00:47:17.400
Ranjit as one of his alternate bros.
他知道兰吉特结了婚并且深爱着妻子。

1050
00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:19.280
He knows he's married and loves his wife.
他知道兰吉特结了婚并且深爱着妻子。

1051
00:47:19.400 --> 00:47:21.280
But he also knows he's mad at him.
但他也知道自己在生他的气。

1052
00:47:21.540 --> 00:47:22.100
He's team Ted.
他是泰德阵营的。

1053
00:47:22.100 --> 00:47:22.600
He knows, yeah.
他知道，对。

1054
00:47:22.680 --> 00:47:23.560
Ranjit is team Ted.
兰吉特是泰德阵营的。

1055
00:47:23.720 --> 00:47:25.300
Ranjit immediately team Ted.
兰吉特立刻加入了泰德阵营。

1056
00:47:25.480 --> 00:47:25.600
Yeah.
对。

1057
00:47:25.640 --> 00:47:25.820
Yeah.
对。

1058
00:47:28.080 --> 00:47:32.940
I liked so much getting to play the turn where Ted is just chill and no big deal.
我特别喜欢演那个转折，就是泰德表现得很冷静，觉得没什么大不了的。

1059
00:47:33.160 --> 00:47:34.960
And then he turns.
然后他突然变脸。

1060
00:47:35.260 --> 00:47:35.980
Like, where'd that come from?
就像是，这从哪儿冒出来的？

1061
00:47:36.060 --> 00:47:37.080
Do you remember writing that?
你还记得当时是怎么写的吗？

1062
00:47:37.220 --> 00:47:38.360
That was really interesting.
那真的很有意思。

1063
00:47:38.540 --> 00:47:39.180
I do.
我记得。

1064
00:47:39.180 --> 00:47:44.800
I remember us deciding it would be a fun reveal.
我记得我们当时觉得这会是一个很有趣的揭秘。

1065
00:47:44.800 --> 00:47:47.540
And you'd like to really think Ted was okay about it.
而且你会真的以为泰德对此并不介意。

1066
00:47:47.640 --> 00:47:50.100
And to Ted very convincingly say he's okay.
并且泰德非常具有说服力地表现得他没事。

1067
00:47:50.100 --> 00:47:55.660
And then out of nowhere erupt, like, this volcano and literally punch Barney in the nuts.
然后毫无征兆地爆发，就像一座火山一样，直接一拳打在巴尼的蛋蛋上。

1068
00:47:56.140 --> 00:47:58.900
I remember, I just, again, it was like an underthought idea.
我记得，我只是觉得，这又是一个没怎么细想的点子。

1069
00:47:59.060 --> 00:48:00.780
It was just like, because you could argue it doesn't make sense.
就好像，因为你完全可以说这在逻辑上说不通。

1070
00:48:00.900 --> 00:48:02.680
Why is Ted hiding that from Barney?
为什么泰德要对巴尼隐瞒这一点？

1071
00:48:02.720 --> 00:48:06.060
Why isn't he immediately like, fuck you, I'm not getting in that limo.
为什么他没有马上说，操你的，我才不上那辆加长轿车。

1072
00:48:06.060 --> 00:48:06.540
I'm not getting in the car.
我才不上这辆车。

1073
00:48:06.540 --> 00:48:06.840
Yeah.
对。

1074
00:48:06.840 --> 00:48:07.100
Yeah.
对。

1075
00:48:07.380 --> 00:48:12.400
And I think it's Ted being like, I'm going to sit on this punch to make it count more.
我觉得这是泰德在想，我要把这拳憋着，好让它更有杀伤力。

1076
00:48:12.480 --> 00:48:14.600
I'm going to make this knockout punch.
我要打出这记漂亮的重拳。

1077
00:48:14.740 --> 00:48:17.640
I'm going to wait for like a little later in the fight.
我要等到比赛稍微靠后的时候再出手。

1078
00:48:17.640 --> 00:48:19.340
I want a fifth round knockout.
我想要在第五回合KO对手。

1079
00:48:19.720 --> 00:48:20.120
Yeah.
对。

1080
00:48:20.340 --> 00:48:21.700
I think that's what it is.
我想就是这样的。

1081
00:48:21.800 --> 00:48:27.500
And I, again, like many things in these nine episodes that we did, you could say, why?
而且我，就像我们制作的这九集里的很多事情一样，你可能会问，为什么？

1082
00:48:27.700 --> 00:48:29.120
Why did Ted do it that way?
为什么泰德要那样做？

1083
00:48:29.240 --> 00:48:30.880
And we underthought it.
而我们当时确实没怎么深思熟虑。

1084
00:48:30.980 --> 00:48:34.360
Well, it's got, it's like, it's a little bit like un-Mosby-ish.
好吧，这有点，这有点不那么像莫斯比的作风。

1085
00:48:34.440 --> 00:48:35.620
There's no mercy in it.
这里面毫无怜悯之情。

1086
00:48:35.740 --> 00:48:37.480
Like, he wants to watch him bleed.
就像，他想看着他流血。

1087
00:48:37.720 --> 00:48:38.580
Yes, I think so.
是的，我也这么觉得。

1088
00:48:38.760 --> 00:48:44.100
I think Ted lured him in to get, to connect squarely on the jaw with that punch.
我觉得泰德是故意引诱他上钩，好用那一拳结结实实地轰在他的下巴上。

1089
00:48:44.280 --> 00:48:46.760
And also like punching in the balls.
而且还是打在蛋蛋上。

1090
00:48:48.500 --> 00:48:54.320
Yeah, like he's going, he's going where like, this is the part of you that fucked up this friendship.
对，就好像他在说，这是你搞砸这段友谊的罪魁祸首。

1091
00:48:58.380 --> 00:49:02.400
Yes, punching in the face would be, I'm going to cut out the middleman and go right to the source.
对，打在脸上的话，我就省去中间商赚差价，直接找到根源了。

1092
00:49:02.620 --> 00:49:08.860
And also is that the little literary flourish at the end, you know, I'm putting you in a box of stuff I have no use for anymore.
还有最后那个小小的文学修辞，你知道的，我把你装进一个我再也用不着的杂物箱里。

1093
00:49:09.060 --> 00:49:10.600
Like, it's really brutal.
这真的太残忍了。

1094
00:49:10.900 --> 00:49:11.380
It's brutal.
太残忍了。

1095
00:49:11.380 --> 00:49:12.240
It's a brutal takedown.
这是一次极其残忍的暴击。

1096
00:49:12.400 --> 00:49:12.500
Yeah.
对。

1097
00:49:12.640 --> 00:49:15.180
And you really buy friendship over.
而你真的会相信友谊彻底完蛋了。

1098
00:49:15.180 --> 00:49:20.880
Barney used to, Barney liked to throw around that, that phrase as in jest about minor things.
巴尼以前，巴尼喜欢把这句话当成开玩笑来形容一些小事。

1099
00:49:21.200 --> 00:49:26.240
No, this is friendship over, but it's real and it's coming at Barney instead of him saying it's somebody else.
不，这次是真正的友谊玩完了，但它是动真格的，而且是冲着巴尼来的，而不是由他说出来扣在别人头上。

1100
00:49:26.340 --> 00:49:35.020
And I think, I think that Ted also is like looking back over the years of their friendship and all the ways that he did say yes, even begrudgingly, even with a big eye roll.
而且我觉得，我觉得泰德也是在回顾他们多年的友谊，以及他所有那些虽然极其不情愿、还直翻白眼但最终还是答应下来的时刻。

1101
00:49:35.380 --> 00:49:35.540
Yeah.
对。

1102
00:49:35.540 --> 00:49:39.440
He went along with a lot of this guy's cockamamie plans.
他跟着这家伙胡闹了不少荒唐的计划。

1103
00:49:39.480 --> 00:49:40.360
He really did.
确实如此。

1104
00:49:40.360 --> 00:49:41.640
And Barney knows it.
巴尼也很清楚这一点。

1105
00:49:41.800 --> 00:49:47.560
And that is why we've never seen Barney sadder than the final moments of this episode.
这就是为什么我们从未见过比这集结尾更让人伤心的巴尼。

1106
00:49:47.840 --> 00:49:51.420
And I think that, God, I remember it just felt exciting.
而且我觉得，天哪，我记得那种感觉真的很让人兴奋。

1107
00:49:51.600 --> 00:49:54.320
It felt like we have something to write about that's real.
感觉就像我们终于有了一些真实的东西可以写。

1108
00:49:54.820 --> 00:50:00.480
Life isn't all about, yeah, how much matter can be described as a romantic comedy, but it is more than that.
生活不全是关于，对吧，多少事情能被归结为浪漫喜剧，但它远不止于此。

1109
00:50:00.480 --> 00:50:05.140
And some of the worst heartbreaks come outside of the romantic realm.
有些最痛彻心扉的伤心并非来自浪漫关系的领域。

1110
00:50:05.180 --> 00:50:08.800
So you have this, you have this like really deeply tragic ending.
所以这就有了，你拥有了这样一个极其悲剧的结局。

1111
00:50:09.000 --> 00:50:09.880
Barney is isolated.
巴尼被孤立了。

1112
00:50:09.880 --> 00:50:10.640
He's alone.
他孤身一人。

1113
00:50:10.920 --> 00:50:19.280
But then I'm just thinking like as a writer, you have a great vacuum that needs to be filled, a comic premise that presents itself.
但接着我又在想，作为编剧，你拥有了一个亟待填补的真空，一个自然浮现的喜剧设定。

1114
00:50:19.420 --> 00:50:19.520
Yeah.
是的。

1115
00:50:19.620 --> 00:50:21.640
Which is like, who's Barney going to roll around with now?
那就是，巴尼现在能和谁混在一起？

1116
00:50:21.800 --> 00:50:23.660
Like he needs a bro.
就像他需要一个好兄弟。

1117
00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:27.360
And that will be discussed next week.
这将在下周讨论。

1118
00:50:27.520 --> 00:50:28.080
Next week.
下周。

1119
00:50:28.540 --> 00:50:29.160
Wait for it.
拭目以待。

1120
00:50:29.160 --> 00:50:31.100
I am guilty.
我有罪。

1121
00:50:32.140 --> 00:50:33.680
Please acquit me.
请判我无罪吧。

1122
00:50:34.180 --> 00:50:35.760
All sins are forgiven.
所有的罪孽都被原谅了。

1123
00:50:36.420 --> 00:50:38.420
In New York City.
在纽约市。

